    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n- Open index.html to view the sample club page and its design plan.\r\n- Read the 'Design Plan for the Club Page' carefully.\r\n- Use the 'Prompt Dial' controls to change the page's appearance.\r\n- Compare the modified page with the details in the design plan.\r\n- Identify which visual aspects match the plan and which do not.\r\n- Think about whether you would 'Keep', 'Redirect' with a new prompt, or 'Edit' a small part yourself.",
